  "title": "Modo 1.7.0 — Native Setup Wizard, OTA Updates, Curated Icon Packs, and Developer Studio",
  "releaseNotes": "• Windows Native Setup Wizard: Dedicated user installer with customizable shortcuts, Explorer context menu, and Add/Remove Programs registration.\n• In-App OTA Updates: Automatic background checks and one-click in-app update installation on Windows and macOS.\n• Canonical macOS HIG Menu Hierarchy: Standard File, Edit, View, Style, and Tools menus with system keyboard shortcuts.\n• Curated Community Icon Packs: Added WhiteSur macOS, Tela Minimal, Lawnicons Themed, macOSicons Hub, Mac Icons Pro, macOS Folders, and Tabler & Lucide Vector.\n• Developer Export Suite: One-click Xcode Asset Catalogs (AppIcon.appiconset) and Web Favicon bundles (.ico, PNGs, manifest).\n• Pure Scalable Vector Export (.svg): Vector engine with XML filter shaders for glass, titanium, and glow.\n• Interactive 3D Parallax Tilt: Apple TV-style perspective physics and specular reflections in inspector.",
